    "title": "Last-minute change to transportation bill impacts long-term public transit funding - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Books Authors ,\n8 hours ago SALEM, Ore. (KATU) — A late change to Oregon Governor Tina Kotek's transportation bill may have long-term impacts on public transportation agencies across the state. The amendment, which passed on Sunday, would cancel the 0.1% increase to the state's payroll tax after two years. The initial version of Gov. Kotek's bill would have made this increase permanent. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
